{
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:00",
      "en": "Chicken Little",
      "zh": "小鸡快跑"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:03",
      "en": "(",
      "zh": "（"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:10",
      "en": "Let me tell you a story about a chicken.",
      "zh": "我来给你讲一只鸡的故事。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:13",
      "en": "His name is Chicken Little.",
      "zh": "他的名字叫小鸡快跑。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:16",
      "en": "He lives in a normal little chicken house in a normal little town.",
      "zh": "他住在一个普普通通的小镇上，一栋普普通通的小鸡舍里。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:21",
      "en": "Chicken Little is neither tall nor short.",
      "zh": "小鸡快跑不高，也不矮。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:24",
      "en": "He is neither fat nor thin.",
      "zh": "他不胖，也不瘦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:27",
      "en": "He is neither smart nor stupid.",
      "zh": "他不聪明，也不笨。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:29",
      "en": "He is a completely normal chicken.",
      "zh": "他是一只完完全全普普通通的鸡。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:33",
      "en": "One completely normal morning, Chicken Little is eating his breakfast in the kitchen.",
      "zh": "一个再普通不过的早晨，小鸡快跑正在厨房里吃早餐。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:39",
      "en": "(He likes toast with butter and coffee with cream.)",
      "zh": "（他喜欢涂了黄油的吐司，和加了奶油的咖啡。）"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:42",
      "en": "He is reading the internet.",
      "zh": "他正在上网看东西。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:44",
      "en": "He sees a terrifying story with a terrifying headline.",
      "zh": "他看到一条吓人的消息，标题也很吓人。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:49",
      "en": "It says: THE SKY IS FALLING!",
      "zh": "标题写着：天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:53",
      "en": "He is so scared that he drops his toast into his coffee.",
      "zh": "他吓得把吐司掉进了咖啡里。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:57",
      "en": "PLOP!",
      "zh": "扑通！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:58",
      "en": "“The sky is falling?",
      "zh": "“天要塌下来了？"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "01:00",
      "en": "” “THE SKY IS FALLING!",
      "zh": "”“天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "01:02",
      "en": "” shouts Chicken Little.",
      "zh": "”小鸡快跑喊道。"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "01:04",
      "en": "“I have to warn everyone!",
      "zh": "“我得去通知所有人！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "01:06",
      "en": "” First, he emails the story to one-thousand of his closest friends.",
      "zh": "”他先把这条消息发给了他最要好的一千个朋友。"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "01:12",
      "en": "Then runs down the road to warn everyone else.",
      "zh": "然后沿着路跑去通知其他人。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "01:18",
      "en": "The first person he meets on the road is Gwen the Hen.",
      "zh": "他在路上遇到的第一个人是母鸡格温。"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "01:22",
      "en": "She is coming from the supermarket.",
      "zh": "她刚从超市回来。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "01:25",
      "en": "“Good morning, Chicken Little!",
      "zh": "“早上好，小鸡快跑！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "01:27",
      "en": "” says Gwen the Hen.",
      "zh": "”母鸡格温说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "01:28",
      "en": "“Where are you going?",
      "zh": "“你要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "01:30",
      "en": "Why are you so scared?",
      "zh": "你怎么吓成这样？"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "01:32",
      "en": "” “The sky is falling!",
      "zh": "”“天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "01:34",
      "en": "” \"THE SKY IS FALLING!\"",
      "zh": "”“天要塌下来了！”"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "01:35",
      "en": "says Chicken Little.",
      "zh": "小鸡快跑说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "01:37",
      "en": "“Really?",
      "zh": "“真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "01:38",
      "en": "How do you know?",
      "zh": "你怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "01:40",
      "en": "” asks Gwen.",
      "zh": "”格温问。"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "01:41",
      "en": "“I saw it on the internet!",
      "zh": "“我在网上看到的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "01:43",
      "en": "” says Chicken Little.",
      "zh": "”小鸡快跑说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "01:45",
      "en": "“Holy moly!",
      "zh": "“我的天哪！"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "01:46",
      "en": "It must be true!",
      "zh": "那一定是真的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "01:48",
      "en": "” says Gwen.",
      "zh": "”格温说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "01:49",
      "en": "“Let's go!",
      "zh": "“我们快走！"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "01:50",
      "en": "” And so Chicken Little and Gwen the Hen run down the road towards the pond.",
      "zh": "”于是小鸡快跑和母鸡格温沿着路朝池塘跑去。"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "01:57",
      "en": "When they reach the pond, they meet Chuck the Duck.",
      "zh": "到了池塘边，他们遇见了鸭子查克。"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "02:01",
      "en": "He is having a bath.",
      "zh": "他正在洗澡。"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "02:03",
      "en": "“Hello, you two!",
      "zh": "“你们好呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "02:04",
      "en": "” says Chuck the Duck.",
      "zh": "”鸭子查克说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "02:06",
      "en": "“Where are you going?",
      "zh": "“你们要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "02:08",
      "en": "Why are you so scared?",
      "zh": "怎么吓成这样？"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "02:10",
      "en": "” “The sky is falling!",
      "zh": "”“天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "02:12",
      "en": "The sky is falling!",
      "zh": "天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "02:13",
      "en": "” say Chicken Little and Gwen the Hen together.",
      "zh": "”小鸡快跑和母鸡格温一起说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "02:18",
      "en": "“Really?",
      "zh": "“真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "02:19",
      "en": "How do you know?",
      "zh": "你们怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
