      "en": "“Let’s go!",
      "zh": "“我们快走！"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "02:30",
      "en": "” So Chicken Little, Gwen the Hen, and the Chuck the Duck run down the road towards the farm.",
      "zh": "”于是小鸡快跑、母鸡格温和鸭子查克沿着路朝农场跑去。"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "02:39",
      "en": "When they reach the farm they meet Bruce the Goose.",
      "zh": "到了农场，他们遇见了鹅布鲁斯。"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "02:42",
      "en": "He is reading poetry to Percy the pigeon.",
      "zh": "他正在给鸽子珀西念诗。"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "02:46",
      "en": "“Hello everyone!",
      "zh": "“大家好呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "02:47",
      "en": "” says Bruce the Goose.",
      "zh": "”鹅布鲁斯说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "02:49",
      "en": "“Where are you going?",
      "zh": "“你们要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "02:51",
      "en": "Why are you so scared?",
      "zh": "怎么吓成这样？"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "02:53",
      "en": "” “The sky is falling.",
      "zh": "”“天要塌下来了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
