      "en": "” everyone yells.",
      "zh": "”大家喊道。"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "02:59",
      "en": "“Really?",
      "zh": "“真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "03:00",
      "en": "How do you know?",
      "zh": "你们怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "03:01",
      "en": "” asks Percy the pigeon.",
      "zh": "”鸽子珀西问。"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "03:04",
      "en": "“WE SAW IT ON THE INTERNET!!",
      "zh": "“我们在网上看到的！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "03:07",
      "en": "” they all say.",
      "zh": "”他们齐声说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "03:08",
      "en": "“Goodness gracious!",
      "zh": "“天哪天哪！"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "03:10",
      "en": "It must be true!",
      "zh": "那一定是真的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "03:12",
      "en": "” says Bruce.",
      "zh": "”布鲁斯说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "03:13",
      "en": "“There is no time to read poetry now.",
      "zh": "“现在可没工夫念诗了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "03:16",
      "en": "Let's go!",
      "zh": "我们快走！"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "03:16",
      "en": "” And Chicken Little, Gwen the Hen, Chuck the Duck, Bruce the Goose and Percy the Pigeon run down the road towards the town.",
      "zh": "”于是小鸡快跑、母鸡格温、鸭子查克、鹅布鲁斯和鸽子珀西沿着路朝镇上跑去。"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "03:26",
      "en": "On the main street, they meet Fred the Fox.",
      "zh": "在大街上，他们遇见了狐狸弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "03:31",
      "en": "He is sitting at a cafe, writing on his laptop.",
      "zh": "他正坐在咖啡馆里，在笔记本电脑上写着什么。"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "03:34",
      "en": "“Hello everyone!",
      "zh": "“大家好呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "03:36",
      "en": "” says Fred the Fox.",
      "zh": "”狐狸弗雷德说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "03:38",
      "en": "“Where are you going?",
      "zh": "“你们要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "03:40",
      "en": "Why are you so scared?",
      "zh": "怎么吓成这样？"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "03:42",
      "en": "” “THE SKY IS FALLING!\"",
      "zh": "”“天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "03:45",
      "en": "THE SKY IS FALLING!",
      "zh": "天要塌下来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "03:47",
      "en": "” everyone yells.",
      "zh": "”大家喊道。"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "03:50",
      "en": "“Really?",
      "zh": "“真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "03:51",
      "en": "How do you know?",
      "zh": "你们怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "03:53",
      "en": "” asks Fred.",
      "zh": "”弗雷德问。"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "03:54",
      "en": "“WE SAW IT ON THE INTERNET!!!!",
      "zh": "“我们在网上看到的！！！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "03:58",
      "en": "” they all shout.",
      "zh": "”他们齐声喊道。"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "04:01",
      "en": "“Wow!",
      "zh": "“哇！"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "04:02",
      "en": "Well then it must be true!",
      "zh": "那肯定错不了了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "04:06",
      "en": "” says the fox.",
      "zh": "”狐狸说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "04:08",
      "en": "“But don’t worry, friends, I know the perfect place to hide.\"",
      "zh": "“不过别担心，朋友们，我知道一个躲起来最安全的地方。”"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "04:13",
      "en": "\"Follow me!",
      "zh": "“跟我来！"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "04:14",
      "en": "” Fred the fox leads everyone through the village, down the road, across the field, and up a hill.",
      "zh": "”狐狸弗雷德带着大家穿过村子、沿着路、越过田野，爬上了一座小山。"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "04:22",
      "en": "At the top of the hill is a big, dark cave.",
      "zh": "山顶上有一个又大又黑的洞。"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "04:27",
      "en": "“Come in!",
      "zh": "“进来吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "04:28",
      "en": "Come in!",
      "zh": "进来吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "04:29",
      "en": "” says Fred the fox.",
      "zh": "”狐狸弗雷德说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "04:31",
      "en": "“There is enough room for everybody!",
      "zh": "“这里地方够大，大家都能进来！"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "04:35",
      "en": "The sky won't fall on us here.",
      "zh": "天塌下来也砸不到我们。"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "04:37",
      "en": "We are safe.",
      "zh": "我们安全了。”"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "04:39",
      "en": "And so, one by one, Chicken Little and all of his friends follow the fox into the cave.",
      "zh": "就这样，小鸡快跑和他的朋友们一个接一个，跟着狐狸走进了洞里。"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "04:47",
      "en": "The next morning, Chicken Little and his friends have disappeared.",
      "zh": "第二天早上，小鸡快跑和他的朋友们不见了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "04:51",
      "en": "The cave is empty.",
      "zh": "洞里空空的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "04:53",
      "en": "Where did they go?",
      "zh": "他们去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "04:55",
      "en": "We don’t know for sure.",
      "zh": "我们也不确定。"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "04:57",
      "en": "But I will tell you one thing: Fred the Fox is very happy.",
      "zh": "但有一件事我可以告诉你们：狐狸弗雷德开心极了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "05:01",
      "en": "He has a big, round belly.",
      "zh": "他的肚子又大又圆。"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "05:04",
      "en": "“Silly animals,” he says.",
      "zh": "“傻乎乎的动物们，”他说。"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "05:07",
      "en": "And he sits under a tree, gets his laptop, and begins to write again.",
      "zh": "然后他坐到树下，拿出笔记本电脑，又开始写了起来。"
    }
  ]
}
